{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（17日）早上7時44分，元朗朗屏邨悅屏樓一名女住客在家中暈倒，家人發現立即報警。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，證實36歲姓林女事主當場死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。案件列作「屍體發現」處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"朗屏邨。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129455221664256000278095.jpeg/cquX4Wpg343G95B2xiXbmIzGQV_ywd5S57W4Y-e1uGM\"/><figcaption>朗屏邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:21.629790+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:05:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:58.915993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:57.991511+00:00","content_hash":"38f12c81bc9324d3e17302135adea37f2a09531a0fc8d79c771d4672bacd4edd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}